# fora_adverb_prev.voc — Words directly before 'fora' that make it the adverb (open
# ˈfɔɾɐ) in every context: a preposition ('para fora', 'de fora', 'por fora') or a
# locative adverb of the fixed pairs 'lá fora' and 'cá fora'. They veto every
# cue of the pluperfect of ser/ir.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

para
pra
de
por
lá
cá
